Python<pre><code>def fib(n):
    if n &lt;= 1:
        return n
    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)
</code></pre> <p>复杂度：<code>O(2^n)</code>。</p>

Python<pre><code>def count(lst):
    if len(lst) == 0:
        return 0
    return 1 + count(lst[1:])
</code></pre> <p>复杂度：<code>O(n)</code>。</p>

Python<pre><code>def sum_list(lst):
